{"seq":1,"slug":"app-launch-metrics","title":"启动性能度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/performance-monitoring/app-launch-metrics","wordCount":1206,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"启动性能度量\">启动性能度量</h1><p>用户点击应用图标到看到可交互内容的时间决定了第一印象。研究表明超过 3 秒的启动时间会导致 25% 的用户放弃等待。启动性能不是一个模糊的&quot;快或慢&quot;判断，而是一个可以精确度量、分段归因、持续追踪的工程问题。本文聚焦&quot;如何度量并上报启动指标&quot;——具体的优化技术不在此讨论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>启动性能度量围绕三个关键时刻：<strong>TTID</strong>（Time to Initial Display，首帧绘制完成）、<strong>TTFD</strong>（Time to Full Display，内容完全展示）和 <strong>TTI</strong>（Time to Interactive，用户可交互）。冷启动（进程从零创建）是最重要的度量目标，其内部阶段从 pre-main 到数据加载各有独立的归因价值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"启动类型与阶段划分\">启动类型与阶段划分</h2><p>移动应用启动分为三种类型，各自的度量起点和终点不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>启动类型</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>度量起点</th>\n<th>度量终点</th>\n<th>典型耗时</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Cold Start</td>\n<td>进程不存在，从零创建</td>\n<td>进程 fork</td>\n<td>首帧绘制完成</td>\n<td>1-5s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Warm Start</td>\n<td>进程存活但 Activity 需重建</td>\n<td>Activity.onCreate</td>\n<td>首帧绘制完成</td>\n<td>0.5-2s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hot Start</td>\n<td>Activity 在内存中，直接恢复</td>\n<td>Activity.onResume</td>\n<td>首帧绘制完成</td>\n<td>0.1-0.5s</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Cold Start 是最重要的度量目标，因为它包含所有初始化开销。其内部阶段可进一步细分：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[用户点击图标] --&gt; B[进程创建&lt;br/&gt;Pre-main]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Runtime 初始化&lt;br/&gt;dyld/ART]&#10;    C --&gt; D[Application.onCreate&lt;br/&gt;UIApplicationMain]&#10;    D --&gt; E[首个 Activity/VC&lt;br/&gt;创建与布局]&#10;    E --&gt; F[首帧绘制&lt;br/&gt;TTFD]&#10;    F --&gt; G[内容加载完成&lt;br/&gt;TTI]&#10;&#10;    B ---|T1: 系统阶段| C&#10;    C ---|T2: 框架初始化| D&#10;    D ---|T3: 应用初始化| E&#10;    E ---|T4: UI 构建| F&#10;    F ---|T5: 数据就绪| G\">flowchart LR\n    A[用户点击图标] --&gt; B[进程创建&lt;br/&gt;Pre-main]\n    B --&gt; C[Runtime 初始化&lt;br/&gt;dyld/ART]\n    C --&gt; D[Application.onCreate&lt;br/&gt;UIApplicationMain]\n    D --&gt; E[首个 Activity/VC&lt;br/&gt;创建与布局]\n    E --&gt; F[首帧绘制&lt;br/&gt;TTFD]\n    F --&gt; G[内容加载完成&lt;br/&gt;TTI]\n\n    B ---|T1: 系统阶段| C\n    C ---|T2: 框架初始化| D\n    D ---|T3: 应用初始化| E\n    E ---|T4: UI 构建| F\n    F ---|T5: 数据就绪| G</pre><h2 id=\"关键指标定义\">关键指标定义</h2><p><strong>TTID（Time to Initial Display）</strong>：从启动到首帧绘制完成的时间。Android 通过 <code>reportFullyDrawn()</code> 之前的系统自动测量获取，iOS 通过 <code>UIApplicationDidBecomeActiveNotification</code> 与首次 <code>viewDidAppear</code> 之间的时间差近似。</p>\n<p><strong>TTFD（Time to Full Display）</strong>：从启动到内容完全展示可交互的时间。需要开发者手动标记&quot;完成&quot;时刻：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// Android: 手动上报内容加载完成&#10;class HomeActivity : AppCompatActivity() {&#10;    override fun onCreate(savedInstanceState: Bundle?) {&#10;        super.onCreate(savedInstanceState)&#10;        setContentView(R.layout.activity_home)&#10;&#10;        viewModel.feedData.observe(this) { data -&gt;&#10;            adapter.submitList(data)&#10;            // 数据加载完成，上报 TTFD&#10;            reportFullyDrawn()&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Android: 手动上报内容加载完成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class HomeActivity : AppCompatActivity() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun onCreate(savedInstanceState: Bundle?) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        super.onCreate(savedInstanceState)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        setContentView(R.layout.activity_home)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        viewModel.feedData.observe(this) { data -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            adapter.submitList(data)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            // 数据加载完成，上报 TTFD</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            reportFullyDrawn()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>TTI（Time to Interactive）</strong>：用户可以开始有意义交互的时刻。与 TTFD 的区别在于：画面已显示但如果触摸无响应（仍在后台加载），TTI 尚未达到。</p>\n<p>核心度量公式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>cold</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>pre-main</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>runtime</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>app_init</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>ui_build</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>data_load</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{cold}} = T_{\\text{pre-main}} + T_{\\text{runtime}} + T_{\\text{app\\_init}} + T_{\\text{ui\\_build}} + T_{\\text{data\\_load}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cold</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pre-main</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">runtime</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">app_init</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ui_build</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">data_load</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>各阶段占比的 P50/P90/P99 分位数是追踪启动退化的核心指标。P90 比平均值更能反映用户体验——10% 最差情况下的用户可能遭遇了 5 倍于平均值的等待。</p>\n<h2 id=\"平台启动度量-api\">平台启动度量 API</h2><h3 id=\"android\">Android</h3><p>Android 提供多层启动度量能力：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>API</th>\n<th>覆盖阶段</th>\n<th>精度</th>\n<th>可用版本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>ActivityManager.getHistoricalProcessStartReasons()</code></td>\n<td>Cold/Warm/Hot 区分</td>\n<td>毫秒级</td>\n<td>API 33+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Process.getStartElapsedRealtime()</code></td>\n<td>进程 fork 时间</td>\n<td>毫秒级</td>\n<td>API 24+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>reportFullyDrawn()</code></td>\n<td>内容加载完成</td>\n<td>手动标记</td>\n<td>API 19+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Jetpack Macrobenchmark</td>\n<td>端到端启动基准测试</td>\n<td>微秒级</td>\n<td>测试环境</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Firebase Performance Monitoring 自动采集 <code>_app_start</code> trace，覆盖从 <code>Application.onCreate()</code> 到首个 Activity 的 <code>onResume()</code> 的时间。但它缺少 pre-main（进程创建到 Application 构造）阶段的度量。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ios\">iOS</h3><p>Apple 的 MetricKit <code>MXAppLaunchMetric</code>（iOS 16+）提供启动时间的字段统计：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"func didReceive(_ payloads: [MXMetricPayload]) {&#10;    for payload in payloads {&#10;        if let launchMetrics = payload.applicationLaunchMetrics {&#10;            let resumeTime = launchMetrics.histogrammedResumeTime&#10;            // 分布直方图：P50, P90, P99&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> didReceive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> payloads: [MXMetricPayload]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> payload </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> payloads {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> launchMetrics </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> payload.applicationLaunchMetrics {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> resumeTime </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> launchMetrics.histogrammedResumeTime</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">            // 分布直方图：P50, P90, P99</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Sentry iOS SDK 通过 Hook <code>UIApplicationDelegate</code> 的生命周期方法自动创建 <code>app.start.cold</code> / <code>app.start.warm</code> span：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>sentry_cold</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>viewDidAppear</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>process_start</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{sentry\\_cold}} = t_{\\text{viewDidAppear}} - t_{\\text{process\\_start}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">sentry_cold</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">viewDidAppear</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9821em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">process_start</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"启动-trace-的上报设计\">启动 Trace 的上报设计</h2><p>启动阶段的度量不是单一数字，而是一个分段 Trace。将启动分解为多个 Span 上报，允许后端按阶段聚合分析瓶颈：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;trace_id&quot;: &quot;abc123&quot;,&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;app.start.cold&quot;,&#10;  &quot;duration_ms&quot;: 2340,&#10;  &quot;spans&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;pre_main&quot;, &quot;start&quot;: 0, &quot;end&quot;: 180 },&#10;    { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;ru