ss=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">new</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2663em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1098em;vertical-align:-0.2663em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8435em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4337em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">90</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2421em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">prev</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2663em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>告警阈值设计：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>90</mn></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>200</mn><mtext>ms</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta P_{90} &gt; 200\\text{ms}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">90</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ms</span></span></span></span></span></span>：Warning，团队 review</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>90</mn></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>500</mn><mtext>ms</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta P_{90} &gt; 500\\text{ms}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">90</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ms</span></span></span></span></span></span>：Critical，阻断下一版发布</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>90</mn></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>5000</mn><mtext>ms</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{90} &gt; 5000\\text{ms}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">90</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5000</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ms</span></span></span></span></span></span>：Emergency，立即回滚</li>\n</ul>\n<p>版本间对比必须控制变量：同一设备档次（高端/中端/低端）、同一网络环境、同一地区的用户群体进行同类比较。否则新版本恰好获得更多低端设备用户会导致误判。</p>\n<p>按设备档次分层的启动性能基准（2026 行业参考）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>设备档次</th>\n<th>Cold Start P50</th>\n<th>Cold Start P90</th>\n<th>占比</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>高端（旗舰）</td>\n<td>&lt; 1.0s</td>\n<td>&lt; 1.5s</td>\n<td>~30%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中端</td>\n<td>&lt; 2.0s</td>\n<td>&lt; 3.0s</td>\n<td>~50%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低端</td>\n<td>&lt; 3.5s</td>\n<td>&lt; 5.0s</td>\n<td>~20%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>启动度量与<a href=\"network-api-monitoring\">网络监控</a>存在交叉——启动期间的首屏 API 请求耗时往往是 TTFD 的瓶颈。同时，启动阶段的异常耗时如果触发了系统 watchdog（iOS 上超过约 20s），会被记录为<a href=\"../crash-stability/crash-reporting-systems\">崩溃事件</a>而非性能问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>启动性能度量的核心是分段归因——将总启动时间分解为 pre-main、runtime、app init、UI build、data load 等可独立追踪的阶段。P90 分位数比平均值更能反映真实用户体验。版本间对比必须控制设备档次和网络环境变量。告警阈值应基于相对变化量（退化幅度）而非绝对值，避免用户群体变化导致的误判。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"启动性能度量","id":"启动性能度量"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"启动类型与阶段划分","id":"启动类型与阶段划分"},{"level":2,"text":"关键指标定义","id":"关键指标定义"},{"level":2,"text":"平台启动度量 API","id":"平台启动度量-api"},{"level":3,"text":"Android","id":"android"},{"level":3,"text":"iOS","id":"ios"},{"level":2,"text":"启动 Trace 的上报设计","id":"启动-trace-的上报设计"},{"level":2,"text":"启动退化的监控与告警","id":"启动退化的监控与告警"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"ANR 与卡顿检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/crash-stability/anr-freeze-detection"},"next":{"title":"网络与 API 监控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/performance-monitoring/network-api-monitoring"}}